### ============================
### 🎟️ DISCOUNT
### ============================

### GET all discounts
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/discount

### GET discount by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/discount/:discountId

### CREATE discount
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/discount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DISKON LEBARAN",
  "is_percentage": true,
  "value": 10,
  "min_order_amount": 50000,
  "shareable_code": "LEBARAN10",
  "max_use": 100,
  "used": 0,
  "start_at": "2025-05-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "expired_at": "2025-05-30T00:00:00.000Z",
  "is_active": true,
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001",
  "created_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### UPDATE discount
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/discount/c20a994f-94f9-4dff-82a6-f673165395a4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 15,
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE discount (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/discount/:discountId

---

### ============================
### 🔗 PRODUCT DISCOUNT
### ============================

### GET all product-discount relations
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/product-discount

### GET product-discount by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/product-discount/:productDiscountId

### CREATE product-discount relation
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/product-discount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "d8307ba5-abae-4ead-8109-9379673353b4",
  "discount_id": "c20a994f-94f9-4dff-82a6-f673165395a4",
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001",
  "created_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### UPDATE product-discount relation
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/product-discount/:productDiscountId
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE product-discount relation
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/discount/product-discount/:productDiscountId
